{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff8f2;--accent:#7c5a3e;--muted:#8a6f5a;--soft:#f3e9e1;--green:#7aa28c}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial; color:#3b2e28;background:var(--bg);}
    .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:32px auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
    nav a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;padding:22px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--soft),transparent);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(60,40,30,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin-top:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(60,40,30,0.04)}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
    input[type='text'],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6ddd7;font-size:15px}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6ddd7;color:var(--accent)}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fbf6f3;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #e9ded6;margin-top:12px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px}
    footer.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}
    .svg-deco{width:100%;height:84px;margin-top:6px;opacity:0.28}
    @media(max-width:880px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr} .svg-deco{height:60px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='about.html'>About</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Services</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>How I Work</a>
      <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>
      <a href='faq.html'>Questions</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Reserve</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>
    </nav>

    <header class='hero card'>
      <div>
        <h1>Therapy shaped into steady, practical support</h1>
        <p class='lead'>I offer gentle, evidence-informed care with attention to daily life — practical steps that preserve dignity and attention to who you are now.</p>
      </div>
      <svg class='svg-deco' viewBox='0 0 600 80' preserveAspectRatio='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
            <stop offset='0' stop-color='#f1e6de'/>
            <stop offset='1' stop-color='#fff8f2'/>
          </linearGradient>
          <pattern id='p1' width='20' height='20' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse' patternTransform='rotate(18)'>
            <rect width='20' height='20' fill='transparent'/>
            <path d='M0 10h20' stroke='#fdeee2' stroke-width='1'/>
            <path d='M10 0v20' stroke='#efe0d6' stroke-width='1'/>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width='600' height='80' fill='url(#g1)'/>
        <rect width='600' height='80' fill='url(#p1)' opacity='0.6'/>
      </svg>
    </header>

    <section class='two'>
      <div>
        <div class='card'>
          <h2 style='margin-top:0'>About me</h2>
          <p class='meta'>Licensed clinician based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — offering short and ongoing sessions by appointment.</p>
          <p>I bring a calm, practical orientation: we notice what's present, name small shifts that matter, and plan clear next steps for the week. My work blends thoughtful listening with tools you can use between sessions. Nothing rushed; nothing flashy.</p>
          <p class='meta'>I work with adults around transitions, anxiety, low mood, relationship patterns, and life-stage concerns. Telehealth and limited in-person availability.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='card'>
          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Session Planner</h3>
          <p class='meta'>Build a focused plan you can try for the next 2–6 weeks.</p>
          <label for='goal'>Primary focus for therapy</label>
          <input id='goal' type='text' placeholder='e.g., worry that gets in the way of sleep'>
          <label for='frequency'>Session rhythm</label>
          <select id='frequency'>
            <option value='weekly'>Weekly — steady space to track progress</option>
            <option value='biweekly'>Every other week — room for practice</option>
            <option value='monthly'>Monthly check-ins — focused themes</option>
          </select>
          <label for='focusAreas'>Tactical focuses (comma separated)</label>
          <input id='focusAreas' type='text' placeholder='Boundaries, sleep, short-term planning'>
          <label for='duration'>Prefered plan length</label>
          <select id='duration'>
            <option value='4'>4 sessions</option>
            <option value='6'>6 sessions</option>
            <option value='12'>12 sessions</option>
          </select>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px'>
            <button id='buildPlanBtn'>Create plan</button>
            <button class='secondary' id='clearPlanBtn'>Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id='planSummary' class='summary' aria-live='polite'></div>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px'>
            <button id='copyPlanBtn' class='secondary'>Copy summary</button>
            <a id='bookNow' class='secondary' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:8px;border-radius:8px'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>
          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Confidentiality & scope</h3>
          <p>I maintain clinical confidentiality within legal and ethical limits. I am not able to provide emergency services through this site. If you are in crisis or danger, contact local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>
          <p class='meta'>For scheduling or clinical questions email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='card'>
          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Self-screening intake</h3>
          <p class='meta'>A brief, reflective set of prompts you can bring to your first visit. This is not diagnostic — it helps shape our initial conversation.</p>

          <div id='wizard'>
            <div id='stepContainer'>
              <div class='step' data-step='1'>
                <label>Which concern feels most pressing today?</label>
                <input id='w1' type='text' placeholder='Two to six words'>
              </div>
              <div class='step' data-step='2' style='display:none'>
                <label>How does this show up in day to day life?</label>
                <textarea id='w2' rows='3' placeholder='Sleep, appetite, focus, relationships'></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class='step' data-step='3' style='display:none'>
                <label>What have you tried so far that helps even a little?</label>
                <input id='w3' type='text' placeholder='A practice, a strategy, support person'>
              </div>
              <div class='step' data-step='4' style='display:none'>
                <label>What would a meaningful next step look like?</label>
                <input id='w4' type='text' placeholder='A specific thing you could try in the week ahead'>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px'>
              <button id='nextStep'>Next</button>
              <button id='prevStep' class='secondary'>Back</button>
              <button id='finishWizard' class='secondary'>Produce notes</button>
            </div>

            <div id='wizardOutput' class='summary' style='display:none;margin-top:12px'></div>
            <button id='copyWizard' class='secondary' style='display:none;margin-top:8px'>Copy intake notes</button>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>
          <h4 style='margin-top:0'>Practicalities</h4>
          <p class='meta'>Sessions are private and scheduled by appointment. I offer telehealth and in-person options where permitted. Insurance may be used; please ask when booking.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <footer class='note'>
      Notes: This site does not replace emergency care. If you are at immediate risk, call local emergency services or a crisis hotline. Therapy is a collaborative process; outcomes differ by individual.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Session Planner
    (function(){
      var buildBtn=document.getElementById('buildPlanBtn');
      var clearBtn=document.getElementById('clearPlanBtn');
      var copyBtn=document.getElementById('copyPlanBtn');
      var out=document.getElementById('planSummary');
      function makePlan(){
        var goal=document.getElementById('goal').value.trim();
        var freq=document.getElementById('frequency').value;
        var focus=document.getElementById('focusAreas').value.trim();
        var dur=document.getElementById('duration').value;
        if(!goal) { out.textContent='Please name a primary focus to build a plan.'; return }
        var lines=[];
        lines.push('Personal Plan — '+(goal||'No goal provided'));
        lines.push('Rhythm: '+(freq==='weekly'? 'Weekly' : freq==='biweekly' ? 'Every other week' : 'Monthly'));
        lines.push('Length: '+dur+' sessions');
        if(focus) lines.push('Tactical focuses: '+focus);
        lines.push('Suggested weekly practice: choose 1 small, measurable step to try between sessions (5–20 minutes).');
        lines.push('Check-ins: note what helps and what gets in the way, bring examples to the next session.');
        out.textContent=lines.join('\n');
      }
      function clearPlan(){
        document.getElementById('goal').value='';
        document.getElementById('focusAreas').value='';
        out.textContent='';
      }
      function copyText(el){
        if(!out.textContent) return; navigator.clipboard.writeText(out.textContent).then(function(){
          el.textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(function(){el.textContent='Copy summary'},1400)
        })
      }
      buildBtn.addEventListener('click',makePlan);
      clearBtn.addEventListener('click',clearPlan);
      copyBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){copyText(this)});
    })();

    // Intake wizard
    (function(){
      var step=1; var total=4;
      var next=document.getElementById('nextStep');
      var prev=document.getElementById('prevStep');
      var finish=document.getElementById('finishWizard');
      var out=document.getElementById('wizardOutput');
      var copyBtn=document.getElementById('copyWizard');
      function showStep(n){
        var steps=document.querySelectorAll('#stepContainer .step');
        steps.forEach(function(s){ s.style.display='none' });
        var cur=document.querySelector('#stepContainer .step[data-step="'+n+'"]');
        if(cur) cur.style.display='block';
      }
      next.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(step<total) step++; showStep(step) });
      prev.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(step>1) step--; showStep(step) });
      finish.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var a=document.getElementById('w1').value.trim();
        var b=document.getElementById('w2').value.trim();
        var c=document.getElementById('w3').value.trim();
        var d=document.getElementById('w4').value.trim();
        var lines=[];
        lines.push('Intake notes — bring to first session');
        if(a) lines.push('Primary concern: '+a);
        if(b) lines.push('How it shows up: '+b);
        if(c) lines.push('What helps a little: '+c);
        if(d) lines.push('What a next step might be: '+d);
        lines.push('Questions to ask clinician:');
        lines.push('- How might we prioritize the items above?');
        lines.push('- What are simple practices to try between sessions?');
        out.textContent=lines.join('\n');
        out.style.display='block'; copyBtn.style.display='inline-block'; out.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
      });
      copyBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        if(!out.textContent) return; navigator.clipboard.writeText(out.textContent).then(()=>{this.textContent='Copied'});
      });
      showStep(1);
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Services — Areas of Focus</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffaf6;--brown:#6b4b39;--warm:#f6e9e2;--teal:#6a9a86}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#33261f}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:26px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    nav a{color:var(--brown);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}
    .service{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(60,40,30,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;color:var(--brown)}
    h2{font-size:16px;margin:6px 0}
    p.meta{color:#7b6758;font-size:14px}
    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--teal)}
    ul{margin:8px 0 0 18px}
    .card{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--brown);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;color:#7b6758}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e8dbd1}
    button{background:var(--brown);color:#fff;border:none;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px}
    .muted{color:#7b6758;font-size:13px}
    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='about.html'>About</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Services</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>How I Work</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Reserve</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>
    </nav>

    <header style='margin-bottom:14px'>
      <h1>Ways I typically work with people</h1>
      <p class='meta'>Short, focused offerings alongside ongoing sessions — choose what fits your current need.</p>
    </header>

    <section class='grid'>
      <main>
        <div class='service'>
          <h2>Practical Stress Support</h2>
          <p class='muted'>For sustained stress, role overload, and planning resilience.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>4–8 session short track to build routines and coping strategies</li>
            <li>Tools for day-to-day regulation and boundary setting</li>
            <li>Homework that respects a busy schedule</li>
          </ul>
          <p class='price'>Starting plans from a per-session perspective — we discuss a pacing that suits your life.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='service'>
          <h2>Relationship Patterns & Communication</h2>
          <p class='muted'>Exploring how you show up in important relationships and practical experiments to try between meetings.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Focus on communication skills, limits, and emotional clarity</li>
            <li>Can include partners or family with consent and clear boundaries</li>
          </ul>
          <p class='price'>Flexible options; single sessions to recurring work.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='service'>
          <h2>Transitions & Life Re-framing</h2>
          <p class='muted'>Support through moves, career shifts, parenting changes, or grief.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Short intensives or paced support over months</li>
            <li>Values-focused planning and practical next steps</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class='service'>
          <h2>Focused Skills Track</h2>
          <p class='muted'>A skill-forward package emphasizing one or two practical tools (sleep, worry, or pacing).</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Typically 4 sessions with clear, measurable practices</li>
            <li>Designed so you can continue independently afterwards</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </main>

      <aside>
        <div class='card'>
          <h2 style='margin-top:0'>Plan a pathway</h2>
          <p class='muted'>A small planner to imagine next steps. Create a compact plan and bring it to your booking.</p>
          <label for='sGoal'>What would you like to focus on?</label>
          <input id='sGoal' type='text' placeholder='e.g., feel less scattered at work'>
          <label for='sLength'>Prefered track</label>
          <select id='sLength'>
            <option value='short'>Short (4–6 sessions)</option>
            <option value='medium'>Medium (6–12 sessions)</option>
            <option value='ongoing'>Ongoing</option>
          </select>
          <label for='sNote'>A sentence about what would feel different</label>
          <textarea id='sNote' rows='3' placeholder='A small, concrete change'></textarea>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
            <button id='sBuild'>Make plan</button>
            <button id='sCopy' class='secondary' style='background:transparent;border:1px solid #e8dbd1;color:var(--brown)'>Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div id='sOut' class='muted' style='margin-top:10px;white-space:pre-wrap'></div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Quick self-check</h3>
          <p class='muted'>A short set of questions to bring to our first conversation.</p>
          <div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px'>
            <input id='q1' type='text' placeholder='Most pressing concern'>
            <input id='q2' type='text' placeholder='When did this begin or get worse?'>
            <input id='q3' type='text' placeholder='Support system (who helps you now?)'>
          </div>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
            <button id='qBuild'>Make notes</button>
            <button id='qCopy' class='secondary'>Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div id='qOut' class='muted' style='margin-top:10px;white-space:pre-wrap'></div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <h4 style='margin-top:0'>Booking & policies</h4>
          <p class='muted'>Session length, fees, and cancellation policies are discussed at booking. For questions, reach out at <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--brown)'>{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
          <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' class='cta' style='display:inline-block'>Reserve a first visit</a>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </section>

    <footer style='margin-top:16px;color:#7b6758;font-size:13px'>
      Confidentiality note: conversations remain confidential within legal limits. This is not emergency help; if you are in danger, call local emergency services.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Small planners and copy actions
    document.getElementById('sBuild').addEventListener('click',function(){
      var g=document.getElementById('sGoal').value.trim();
      var l=document.getElementById('sLength').value;
      var n=document.getElementById('sNote').value.trim();
      if(!g){document.getElementById('sOut').textContent='Please name a focus';return}
      var out='Plan: '+g+'\nTrack: '+(l==='short'?'Short':'Medium / Ongoing')+'\nChange: '+(n||'—');
      document.getElementById('sOut').textContent=out;
    });
    document.getElementById('sCopy').addEventListener('click',function(){
      var t=document.getElementById('sOut').textContent; if(!t) return; navigator.clipboard.writeText(t);
    });

    document.getElementById('qBuild').addEventListener('click',function(){
      var a=document.getElementById('q1').value.trim();
      var b=document.getElementById('q2').value.trim();
      var c=document.getElementById('q3').value.trim();
      var out='Intake prompts:\n- Concern: '+(a||'—')+'\n- Timeline: '+(b||'—')+'\n- Support: '+(c||'—');
      document.getElementById('qOut').textContent=out;
    });
    document.getElementById('qCopy').addEventListener('click',function(){
      var t=document.getElementById('qOut').textContent; if(!t) return; navigator.clipboard.writeText(t);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>How I Work — Clinical Approach</title>
  <style>
    :root{--paper:#fffaf5;--clay:#6a4f3b;--sage:#7fa48b;--soft:#f2e8e1}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial;background:var(--paper);color:#33261f}
    .wrap{max-width:880px;margin:28px auto;padding:26px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    nav a{color:var(--clay);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .intro{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--soft),transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
    h1{margin:0;color:var(--clay)}
    .flow{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:14px}
    .step{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(60,40,30,0.05)}
    .step h3{margin:0;font-size:15px}
    ol{margin:8px 0 0 18px}
    .note{color:#806b5b;font-size:14px}
    .widgets{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
    .card{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}
    button{background:var(--clay);color:#fff;border:none;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e8dbd1}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fbf7f4;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:10px;border:1px dashed #e9ded6;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace}
    @media(max-width:900px){.widgets{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='about.html'>About</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Services</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>How I Work</a>
      <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>
      <a href='faq.html'>Questions</a>
    </nav>

    <header class='intro'>
      <h1>Clinical stance — clear, calm, collaborative</h1>
      <p class='note'>I aim for practical clarity: we notice patterns, pick a few small experiments, and review what changes. The work is collaborative — your priorities guide the plan.</p>
    </header>

    <section class='flow'>
      <div class='step' style='flex:1'>
        <h3>1. Intake & goals</h3>
        <p class='note'>We start by listening closely to your current concerns and what you'd like to change. Together we clarify a handful of practical goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='step' style='flex:1'>
        <h3>2. Tools & experiments</h3>
        <p class='note'>Sessions often mix reflective work with specific practices you can apply between visits. Progress is measured by small, meaningful shifts you notice in daily life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class='step' style='flex:1'>
        <h3>3. Review & adjust</h3>
        <p class='note'>We revisit the plan regularly, refining what helps and setting new next steps when appropriate.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style='margin-top:18px'>
      <h2 style='margin-bottom:8px'>What to expect in a first few sessions</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Orientation — paperwork and confidentiality limits.</li>
        <li>Focused conversation — what matters most right now.</li>
        <li>Concrete next steps — a small, testable plan for the week.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class='widgets'>
      <div class='card'>
        <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Session Planner</h3>
        <p class='note'>Draft a short plan to bring to the first appointment.</p>
        <label for='apGoal'>Focus</label>
        <input id='apGoal' type='text' placeholder='What feels most important'>
        <label for='apFreq'>Preferred rhythm</label>
        <select id='apFreq'>
          <option value='weekly'>Weekly</option>
          <option value='biweekly'>Every other week</option>
          <option value='monthly'>Monthly</option>
        </select>
        <label for='apTasks'>Concrete tasks</label>
        <input id='apTasks' type='text' placeholder='One or two small tasks'>
        <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
          <button id='apBuild'>Build</button>
